- (c) remove, disable or work around any part of the Team Software that counts Users or checks a
  Subscription;
- (d) remove or change any license, copyright or other notice in it.

## 6. Modifications

You may modify the Team Software for Your own use under Sections 3 and 4. The Licensor and its
licensors keep all rights in the Team Software and in modifications made to it.

You may submit modifications to the ghostfleet repository under its Contributor License Agreement.

## 7. Termination

This license ends automatically if You breach it. It is reinstated if You cure the breach within
thirty (30) days of becoming aware of it, unless the Licensor has given You notice of the same
kind of breach before.

When it ends, You must stop using the Team Software beyond what Section 3 allows.

